{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2021-05-10 13:44:00', 'title': 'PENELEC TO REJUVENATE UNDERGROUND CABLE TO HELP ENHANCE SERVICE RELIABILITY', 'text': 'ERIE, PA., MAY 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PENELEC, A FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE) UTILITY, PLANS TO INJECT AGING UNDERGROUND DISTRIBUTION LINES SERVING AN ERIE CONDOMINIUM COMPLEX WITH A SILICONE-BASED FLUID THAT SHOULD PROLONG ITS USEFUL LIFE BY UP TO 40 ADDITIONAL YEARS. THIS TECHNOLOGICALLY ADVANCED REPAIR METHOD ALLOWS THE CABLE TO PROVIDE CONTINUED RELIABLE ELECTRIC SERVICE FOR A FRACTION OF THE REPLACEMENT COST AND ELIMINATES THE NEED TO DIG TRENCHES THROUGH LANDSCAPED YARDS AND DRIVEWAYS TO BURY NEW LINES.'}